# =========================================================
# Cloudflare Pages redirects
# ---------------------------------------------------------
# Retired pages from the FormSubmit era. Both were "thank you"
# pages that a third-party form service redirected to after a
# submission; the site now saves submissions itself and shows
# the confirmation in place, so neither page had anything
# linking to it.
#
# They are redirected rather than simply removed because the
# URLs may still exist outside our control - a printed flyer,
# an old email, a bookmark. A 404 tells such a visitor that
# the Foundation's site is broken; a redirect puts them where
# they were trying to get to.
# =========================================================

/thank-you.html           /get-involved.html?type=financial   301
/involved-thank-you.html  /get-involved.html                  301

# Same targets without the extension, in case either was ever
# linked that way.
/thank-you                /get-involved.html?type=financial   301
/involved-thank-you       /get-involved.html                  301
